mouse_filter = 2
text = "Rift Sealing Protocol adds a set of <b>highly dangerous</b> missions to each run, greatly increasing the difficulty of the game.\n\n\nComplete all of the missions and defeat the final boss to seal the Rift and earn 1 point on the <b>Win Streak Leaderboard</b>. Failing to complete any mission will result in a loss and end the current win streak.\n\n\nProtocol runs do not continue into <b>Endless Mode.</b>"
